  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/RESOURCECONFIG/BH_RC_HEADER.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/RESOURCECONFIG/BH_RC_OVERVIEW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"111\"></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">我们让跨平台配置变得简单轻松！</span></h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">在 Forge 上，我们采用官方配置系统来实现热重载。</span></h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">而在 Fabric 上，由于缺乏内置系统，我们使用 JSONC。</span></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">自 1.20 版本起，我们不再使用 Forge 的官方系统，因为其配置文件容易失效。</span></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">我们还提供了一个酷炫的图形界面，方便大家轻松查看和修改配置。</span></h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/gwudTd.png\" alt=\"这配置简直酷到极致！\" width=\"2246\" height=\"1400\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/resourcefulbees\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/RESOURCECONFIG/BH_RC_DISCORD.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"111\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fteamresourceful\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/RESOURCECONFIG/BH_RC_PROMO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"227\"></a></p>",
